<title>UK: Stockholm plans $1.0 bln EMTN programme - Lehman.</title>
<headline>Stockholm plans $1.0 bln EMTN programme - Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The City of Stockholm plans to set up a $1.0 billion multi-currency Euro medium term note (EMTN) programme in the near future, arranger Lehman Brothers said in a statement on Tuesday. The notes were expected to be listed on the Luxembourg Stock Exchange, the statement said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
